; A TYPENAME as the range END bound (`0..uint`) — the sibling of
; `tests/robustness/rangeop_typename_start.cddl`, and its own row because the two bounds are read by
; two separate arms of the range walk (they once failed differently: one `panic!`, one
; `unimplemented!`). Both refuse gracefully now, each naming the bound it could not read.
x = 0..uint
